  "description": "eGraphicsCloud.Plugins.CustomValidationControls provides validation controls alongside CustomReportGenerator, a lightweight and zero-dependency reporting engine for generating dynamic reports in PDF, Excel, Word, CSV, and HTML formats. Built strictly on standard .NET libraries, it eliminates third-party NuGet overhead and supports dictionaries, strongly-typed objects (IEnumerable<T>), and tabular matrices across .NET Framework 2.0–4.8.1, .NET Standard 2.0/2.1, .NET Core 2.0–3.1, .NET 5–10, Mono, Xamarin, and Tizen.",
