  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes – eGraphicsCloud.Plugins.CustomValidationControls\n\n\t\t\tVersion: 3.17.88\n\t\t\tRelease Date: 2026-11-15\n\n\t\t\tWhat's New in Version 3.17.88:\n\t\t\t- Universal .NET compatibility (.NET Framework 2.0–4.8.1, .NET Standard 2.0/2.1, .NET Core 2.0–3.1, .NET 5–10, Mono, Xamarin, Tizen).\n\t\t\t- Zero-dependency CustomReportGenerator supporting PDF, Excel, Word, CSV, and HTML.\n\t\t\t- Supports Dictionaries, strongly-typed IEnumerable<T>, and explicit header/row matrices.\n\t\t\t- Multi-page PDF pagination, proportional column widths, word wrapping, and Page X of Y footers.\n\t\t\t- Rich Excel SpreadsheetML output with frozen headers, typed cells, and auto-sized columns.\n\t\t\t- Rich Word RTF output with full Unicode escaping and repeating page headers.\n\t\t\t- CSV RFC 4180 compliance with UTF-8 BOM and formula-injection protection.\n\t\t\t- Print-ready responsive HTML5 report export.\n\n\t\t\tFeedback & Support:\n\t\t\t- Email: services@egraphicscloud.com\n\t\t\t- Support Portal: https://www.egraphicscloud.com/technical-support",
